> f(x: u8, y: u8) = (x/8)*y + (x/8)*3
> g(x: u8, y: u8) = (x/8)*(y + 3)
> f2(x: u8, y: u8) = ((x/8)*y + (x/8)*3) & 255
> g2(x: u8, y: u8) = ((x/8)*(y + 3)) & 255
> f1(x: u8, y: u8) = ((x/8)*y + (x/8)*3) & 255
> equiv f g
f and g are equal on the domain of f (exhaustive)
> equiv f2 g2
f2 and g2 are equal on the domain of f2 (exhaustive)
> equiv f1 g
f1 and g are equal on the domain of f1 (exhaustive)
> equiv f f2
f and f2 are equal on the domain of f (exhaustive)
